sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>TLS Termination
    participant Server as NeMo Guardrails Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant InputRails as Input Rails<br/>(in-process)
    participant KB as Knowledge Base<br/>(in-process embedding)
    participant LLM as Upstream LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OutputRails as Output Rails<br/>(in-process)

    Note over Client,OutputRails: Flow 1: Chat Completion with Guardrails

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer Token
    Ingress->>Server: HTTP/8000<br/>Header passthrough
    Server->>InputRails: Execute input rail actions<br/>(content safety, jailbreak, SDD, topic)

    alt Input rail requires LLM call
        InputRails->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
        LLM-->>InputRails: Safety classification result
    end

    alt Input blocked
        InputRails-->>Server: Rail violation (blocked)
        Server-->>Client: 200 OK (blocked response)
    end

    Server->>KB: Vector similarity search<br/>(FastEmbed all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
    KB-->>Server: Relevant context chunks

    Server->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token<br/>(with guardrail context)
    LLM-->>Server: Generated response

    Server->>OutputRails: Execute output rail actions<br/>(hallucination, fact-check, output safety)

    alt Output rail requires fact-checking
        OutputRails->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Self-check facts prompt
        LLM-->>OutputRails: Fact verification result
    end

    OutputRails-->>Server: Validated response
    Server-->>Ingress: HTTP 200 (JSON or SSE stream)
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,OutputRails: Flow 2: Standalone Guardrail Check

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/checks<br/>Authorization: Header passthrough
    Ingress->>Server: HTTP/8000
    Server->>InputRails: Execute rail actions<br/>(content safety, jailbreak, SDD)

    alt Rail requires LLM classification
        InputRails->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
        LLM-->>InputRails: Classification result
    end

    InputRails-->>Server: Check results (pass/fail per rail)
    Server-->>Ingress: HTTP 200 (check results JSON)
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS response
